    {
      "slug": "proposed-maui-county-passenger-ferry-to-molokai-and-lanai",
      "title": "Proposed Maui County passenger ferry to Molokaʻi and Lānaʻi",
      "summary": "At a September 17 community meeting, county staff said the Maui Ferry project is \"not a done deal\" and that a draft environmental assessment will be released for public comment. The passenger-only service would be run by a private operator, with Molokaʻi service hoped for by early 2029; the Council will set fares. Lānaʻi service is estimated at about $5 million a year, with tickets covering about $3 million.",
      "topics": [
        "transportation"
      ],
      "status": "active",
