            "retrievedISO": "2026-10-22T07:21:21.243Z"
          },
          "body": "County Council Housing and Land Use Committee"
        },
        {
          "dateISO": "2026-08-25",
          "text": "The September 8th meeting will include a council resolution and zoning changes for the Maui Research and Technology Park.",
