          "text": "The director said the department could talk with the research park's landowner if the commission takes up the map again later.",
          "basis": "said-at-meeting",
          "source": {
            "type": "meeting",
            "videoId": "nBW_aexDotM",
            "ts": "1:29:10",
            "retrievedISO": "2026-10-12T06:30:18.226Z"
          },
          "body": "Maui Planning Commission"
        },
        {
          "dateISO": "2024-12-10",
          "text": "A second motion to designate the whole park special purpose district also failed.",
          "basis": "said-at-meeting",
